#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:1
#: f466e886486f4bb18f5debea5e8acb03
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:3
#: 72ae10319bd546dc877705487fce1c6f
msgid ""
"A Chromium MV3 side panel, renderer-independent card engine, extension "
"service worker, and Express/Postgres broker coordinate one bounded Mage "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"A Chromium MV3 side panel, renderer-independent card engine, extension "
"service worker, and Express/Postgres broker coordinate one bounded Mage "
"artifact."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:5
#: eedaab6f7b924a5aa8346086273b340e
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:11
#: 6299cc3b3ec6483fa19eb1d08d3b10a7
msgid ""
"The extension uses service-worker/content-script messaging and never reads "
"the Colab DOM. Auth0 access tokens stay in `chrome.storage.session`; only a "
"hashed learner reference and the hash of the short-lived callback capability"
" are stored by the broker."
msgstr ""
"The extension uses service-worker/content-script messaging and never reads "
"the Colab DOM. Auth0 access tokens stay in `chrome.storage.session`; only a "
"hashed learner reference and the hash of the short-lived callback capability"
" are stored by the broker."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:13
#: c0de92d91ecd496b9b6e9781eb34364d
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:15
#: 4d9ac2b50bd344ffbf90534bd73bdf0e
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:17
#: 4eb08b2459284ca9bb8602b4df3a8253
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/architecture.md:19
#: d293691cd0fd4f718e9a7e4c5fadb75f
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."

